    "updated_at": "2016-09-26T09:12:28Z",
    "body": "So the main question here is whether WebKit and Blink (paging @smfr and @esprehn) are interested in optimizing `display:none` `<iframe>`s by not creating boxes for elements in such `<iframe>`s' documents.\n",
