    "created_at": "2016-10-04T19:02:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-04T19:02:34Z",
    "body": "So I guess we should fix this in the spec by specifying somewhere that no CSS layout boxes are created for elements inside iframes that are not themselves being rendered. That is, changing the definition of \"has CSS layout boxes\" seems better than changing the definition of \"being rendered\".\n\nI assume that will require CSS spec changes? @zcorpan, could you help us out here?\n\nI'll submit a PR for the cleanup @bzbarsky mentions in the OP.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
