    "created_at": "2018-03-16T17:26:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-03-16T17:26:24Z",
    "body": "When we implemented this [in Blink](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=650433) we discovered that there's a fairly [common pattern](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=819327) among web developers to call Window.print() on display:none iframes. We [updated our implementation](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=819327#c28) to allow layout of display:none iframes during a call to Window.print(), which appears to match the behavior of other JS implementations. Should we update the spec to include this caveat?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
