    "created_at": "2019-05-25T00:14:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-25T00:14:02Z",
    "body": "The problem is that the size of an iframe, whether it renders anything, and even when it renders,\r\nis controlled by its parent. Also, your proposal has serious performance implications. It's really important not to do unnecessary rendering work.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
